0 FILE 6951 - Robot Command Center.ldr
0 Large blue and grey space station base built with plates, bricks, and hinged panels, featuring grille-patterned slopes, arm mechanisms with grab jaws, and docking bays for a rover and spaceship, manned by three classic-space minifigs.
0 Name: 6951 - Robot Command Center.ldr
0 Author: Ignacio Fernandez Galvan [jellby]
0 !LDRAW_ORG Model
0 !LICENSE Redistributable under CCAL version 2.0 : see CAreadme.txt

0 !THEME Classic Space
0 !KEYWORDS robot, rover, rocket, spaceship, 1984

0 !HISTORY 2012-12-04 [jellby] Initial creation

0 !HELP Rover, Spaceship and Rocket are detachable and can be used as independent models

